              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 20:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Atu a Iziraeli achisafiri kula phatu phoihwa Visima vya Ana a Jakani hadi Mosera. Aruni achifwa na achizikpwa kuko. Eliazari mwanawe, achihala nafwasiye kama mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hipho, achisafiri hadi Gudigoda na kula Gudigoda hadi Jotibatha, seemu yenye vidzuho vinji vinavyojera madzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.5+NUM.3.6+NUM.3.7+NUM.3.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 3:5–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu achitenga atu a mbari ya Lawi akale atsukuli a Sanduku ra Chilagane ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, ahumike mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu kama alavyadzi-sadaka na abariki atu kpwa dzinare. Hivi ndivyo anavyohenda hadi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo mana Alawi taana seemu ya tsi ya kurisi dza mbari zanjina. Mwenyezi Mlungu mwenye ndiye urisi wao, dza viratu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, arivyoaahidi.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
